    {
      "slug": "ai-isnt-what-is-making-beauty-less-personal",
      "title": "AI isn't what's making beauty less personal",
      "summary": "We've spent years teaching beauty software to remember clients. The stylist doing the remembering could use a little help.",
      "category": "Clients",
      "tags": [
        "notes",
        "clients"
      ],
      "cover": null,
      "published_at": "2026-11-05T09:00:00Z",
      "reading_minutes": 6,
      "author_name": "Jasmine",
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Picture a client who has sat in the same stylist's chair for six years."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The client remembers. Does the system?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Clients are loyal to people, not buildings. "
            },
            {
              "text": "Read the Phorest survey",
              "href": "https://www.phorest.example/survey"
            },
            {
              "text": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Remembering clients is the job."
            }
          ],
          "cite": "Jasmine"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            [
              {
                "text": "Formulas"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "text": "Heat limits"
              }
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "tip",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Keep sensitive notes on the appointment, not in a DM thread."
            }
          ]
        },
